       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TPCO02.
      * CORPORATE CUSTOMER - CONTROLLING INTEREST SCREEN
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-CONTROLLING-PCT        PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE 25.00.
       01  WS-HOLDING.
           05  WS-SHARES             PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
           05  WS-CAPITAL            PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
           05  WS-PROFITS            PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-APPOINTS-MAJORITY      PIC X VALUE 'N'.
       01  WS-OWNER-TYPE             PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-SHARES
           ACCEPT WS-CAPITAL
           ACCEPT WS-PROFITS
           ACCEPT WS-APPOINTS-MAJORITY
           PERFORM 2000-CLASSIFY
           DISPLAY 'OWNER: ' WS-OWNER-TYPE
           STOP RUN.
       2000-CLASSIFY.
           MOVE 'NONE' TO WS-OWNER-TYPE
           IF WS-SHARES > WS-CONTROLLING-PCT
              OR WS-CAPITAL > WS-CONTROLLING-PCT
              OR WS-PROFITS > WS-CONTROLLING-PCT
              MOVE 'OWNERSHIP' TO WS-OWNER-TYPE
           ELSE
              IF WS-APPOINTS-MAJORITY = 'Y'
                 MOVE 'CONTROL' TO WS-OWNER-TYPE
              END-IF
           END-IF.
